---
layout: base.njk
title: Newsletter & Opportunity
---


Subscribe for updates, or browse current opportunities and newsletter issues below.

<div class="post-list">
{% for post in collections.newsletter | reverse %}
  <article class="post-card">
    <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
    <p class="post-date">{{ post.data.date.toDateString() }}</p>
    <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
  </article>
{% endfor %}
</div>
